{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/b259a571b3508363e8235f8e52cf4a36.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1865. The fires of the Civil War have died down and America is once again expanding westwards. The Wild West is a frontier where everyone lives and dies by the gun. You are the captain of a squad of government soldiers sent to bring law and order, to hunt down the bandits and robbers that plague honest folks just trying to make a living out west\u00a0 - and unknowingly step into a much larger fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by spaghetti western classics, A Fistful of Yankees is a real-time strategy game set in the heyday of the Wild West. Lead a squad of Yankee soldiers into cinematic fights with bandits, navigate treacherous badlands, and unravel a devious plot straight out of a Western comic book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/910a65b43b3bf0d36b3b244017a11522.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West: Experience the iconic period of American history in a unique spaghetti western, with a revolver in hand and a squad of Yankees at your back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/f23bef32460171b6cfb01a434d2d4cd4.poster.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/f23bef32460171b6cfb01a434d2d4cd4.webm?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/f23bef32460171b6cfb01a434d2d4cd4.mp4?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Tactical Gunfights: There are no duels on the lawless frontier. Find cover for your soldiers, set up chokepoints, and use clever tactics and special abilities to overcome your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/d8e85e2376628b63684693c2187328aa.poster.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/d8e85e2376628b63684693c2187328aa.webm?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/d8e85e2376628b63684693c2187328aa.mp4?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontier Management: You're a long way from home out west and wagon trains are few. Wisely manage your soldiers and prestige earned - or be prepared to go out like Custer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/9c2a0c5c46fdf59e747f9be624e2a3a7.poster.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/9c2a0c5c46fdf59e747f9be624e2a3a7.webm?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/9c2a0c5c46fdf59e747f9be624e2a3a7.mp4?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling Campaign: Fighting under the Stars and Stripes will take you from arid badlands to lush Northwoods, following the trail of a cruel plot hatched by an even worse kind of robber than the usual bandits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/7c6aa35cfce800c5a125716ea78656be.poster.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/7c6aa35cfce800c5a125716ea78656be.webm?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/7c6aa35cfce800c5a125716ea78656be.mp4?t=1771445747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/62c224e12b9138ba4a60714e224ad68a104aed12.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/fccce4c717d66bb464206f11de3c08771da9a0d7.jpg"},{"name":"Blood&Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/090ae957e12504c14b81dfa7dfc85ca2facb59ea.jpg"},{"name":"Coal Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/0c1fae349c5f91d35a11ed44a962b3c0bf2b2767.jpg"},{"name":"Confederates are back !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/bc3a175e7d73fc5b345a6e586af957f8e964d454.jpg"},{"name":"The last ride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/df59653597203f175e0176cd9f0b100397042255.jpg"},{"name":"Truth or Life ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/24d0b9a39c2b2e55e2db227cfaa30a0538ffe352.jpg"},{"name":"Avenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/bdf0d214bfdab83bb9173cd817f27cff3ae19204.jpg"},{"name":"Yankee Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/2986dca9986f23e12377bfdcbfdf8a7c3222bab4.jpg"},{"name":"Gravedigger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2936470/8f6f0479cb89fba7dff3d7340b22687e86753374.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2936470?t=1771445747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771445747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/fd36607ed4ec631ba273ed450debf175fd6a7aee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771445747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/fd36607ed4ec631ba273ed450debf175fd6a7aee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771445747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/b259a571b3508363e8235f8e52cf4a36.avif?t=1771445747\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1865. The fires of the Civil War have died down and America is once again expanding westwards. The Wild West is a frontier where everyone lives and dies by the gun. You are the captain of a squad of government soldiers sent to bring law and order, to hunt down the bandits and robbers that plague honest folks just trying to make a li